 "description": "Get an AniList user's public profile: name, about text, avatar, donator status \u2014 plus their account settings (title/name-language preferences, notification toggles, list display options). Confirmed live these settings are NOT viewer-gated, so they're included for any user, not just the authenticated caller. Accepts an exact AniList username directly \u2014 no need to call search_user first unless you only have a partial/fuzzy name and need to look up the exact one. Need statistics too? Use get_full_user_info instead of also calling get_user_stats separately.",
